### Scenario I: Execute Session Logout / Blacklist Token
POST {{Hostname}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{BobToken}}

### Scenario J: Replaying a Blacklisted Token (Should return 401 Unauthorized instantly)
GET {{Hostname}}/api/tasks/my
Authorization: Bearer {{BobToken}}